<title>BELGIUM: SOCCER-BELGIUM BEAT SAN MARINO IN UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BELGIUM BEAT SAN MARINO IN UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>MECHELEN, Belgium 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium beat San Marino 3-0 (halftime 0-0) in their European under-21 championship group seven qualifying match on Friday:</p>
<p>Scorers: Tom Caluwe 52, Joeri Pardo 67, Carl Hoefkens 72 penalty</p>
<p>    Standings	    P   W   D   L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p>1. Netherlands	   6   4   1   1   18  3   13</p>
<p>2. Wales		   6   4   0   2    9  5   12</p>
<p>3. Belgium		 6   3   1   2   13  7   10</p>
<p>4. Turkey		  5   3   0   2    9  4    9</p>
<p>5. San Marino	    7   0   0   7    1 31    0</p>
</text>
